* Tue Jul 14 2026 Ferry Meng <mengferry@linux.alibaba.com> [6.6.102-5.3.4_rc1%%DIST%%]
- net: skbuff: propagate shared-frag marker through frag-transfer helpers (Hyunwoo Kim)
- net/sched: fix pedit partial COW leading to page cache corruption (Rajat Gupta)
- locking/rtmutex: Skip remove_waiter() when waiter is not enqueued (Davidlohr Bueso) {CVE-2026-53166}
- rtmutex: Use waiter::task instead of current in remove_waiter() (Keenan Dong)
- eventpoll: fix ep_remove struct eventpoll / struct file UAF (Christian Brauner) {CVE-2026-46242}
- eventpoll: move epi_fget() up (Christian Brauner) {CVE-2026-46242}
- eventpoll: rename ep_remove_safe() back to ep_remove() (Christian Brauner) {CVE-2026-46242}
- eventpoll: drop vestigial __ prefix from ep_remove_{file,epi}() (Christian Brauner) {CVE-2026-46242}
- eventpoll: kill __ep_remove() (Christian Brauner) {CVE-2026-46242}
- eventpoll: split __ep_remove() (Christian Brauner) {CVE-2026-46242}
- eventpoll: use hlist_is_singular_node() in __ep_remove() (Christian Brauner) {CVE-2026-46242}
- file: add fput() cleanup helper (Christian Brauner) {CVE-2026-46242}

